fun main() { print @; }
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// w03_lexerror.mini - a LEXER error (for the phase-label explanation).
//
// Try:  minic tokens w03/w03_lexerror.mini   -> exit 1:
//         w03/w03_lexerror.mini:1:20: lex: unexpected character '@'
//
// '@' is not a character Mini knows, so scanToken() rejects it. The label is
// "lex:" - the error happens before the parser ever sees a token.
